Title: Outrigger regression
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Elliot Young
Maintainer: Elliot Young <ey244@cam.ac.uk>
Description: Performs (distributionally adaptive) outrigger local polynomial regression,estimating a conditional mean function, using a nonlinear, score-matching spline based estimator of the conditional score function.
